(5708016, 829903, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like how you caught the sun beams coming through the break in the clouds.  It''s very dramatic and seems like the rays are coming down on the ship.  With that said, I think you could have possibly made this a stronger image by cropping out perhaps a quarter to a third of the right half of the image, and maybe cropping out half of the water.  I think this would have helped the image because the rays are going top right toward lower left and the ship looks like it''s going right to left.  Just MHO.  Good luck in the voting.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like how you caught the sun beams coming through the break in the clouds.  It''s very dramatic and seems like the rays are coming down on the ship.  With that said, I think you could have possibly made this a stronger image by cropping out perhaps a quarter to a third of the right half of the image, and maybe cropping out half of the water.  I think this would have helped the image because the rays are going top right toward lower left and the ship looks like it''s going right to left.  Just MHO.  Good luck in the voting.', '2009-11-01 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
