(5709138, 830481, 30982, '<td valign="top">About a dozen people are going to tell you your horizon is not level.  It needs to be rotated about 1 degree counterclockwise.  If you use Photoshop, there''s a little ruler tool you can drag along your horizon, then use Rotate, arbitrarily, and it will automagically rotate your image to level based on that line you drew with the ruler tool.</td>', 'About a dozen people are going to tell you your horizon is not level.  It needs to be rotated about 1 degree counterclockwise.  If you use Photoshop, there''s a little ruler tool you can drag along your horizon, then use Rotate, arbitrarily, and it will automagically rotate your image to level based on that line you drew with the ruler tool.', '2009-11-01 15:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
