(5709810, 826183, 90495, '<td valign="top">I hope his last name isn`t bones.</td>', 'I hope his last name isn`t bones.', '2009-11-01 23:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709815, 830450, 66616, '<td valign="top">Nice work, great tones.</td>', 'Nice work, great tones.', '2009-11-01 23:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709822, 830395, 52336, '<td valign="top">I would have rated higher but for the selective desat, something I think never really works very well.  6</td>', 'I would have rated higher but for the selective desat, something I think never really works very well.  6', '2009-11-01 23:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709833, 829133, 52336, '<td valign="top">:D  One''s a voyeur though... ;-)</td>', ':D  One''s a voyeur though... ;-)', '2009-11-01 23:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709840, 830396, 63398, '<td valign="top">Lovely, warm image......8</td>', 'Lovely, warm image......8', '2009-11-01 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709842, 826631, 63398, '<td valign="top">Superb!......8</td>', 'Superb!......8', '2009-11-01 23:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709861, 825651, 52336, '<td valign="top">The issue for me is that it''s just too underexposed.  The lighting is otherwise lovely, nice and soft, highlighting the softness of her features wonderfully, but it''s just too dark for me.  Not lit well enough to fully appreciate, skillfully set up though the lighting is.  The portion of the backdrop behind her face that''s lit nicely shows off the softness of her profile.  I understand size restrictions, but a tighter crop could have resulted in a larger image and thus one with more impact (did you consider square crop?).  This could have been great.  Sorry, only 6. :-(</td>', 'The issue for me is that it''s just too underexposed.  The lighting is otherwise lovely, nice and soft, highlighting the softness of her features wonderfully, but it''s just too dark for me.  Not lit well enough to fully appreciate, skillfully set up though the lighting is.  The portion of the backdrop behind her face that''s lit nicely shows off the softness of her profile.  I understand size restrictions, but a tighter crop could have resulted in a larger image and thus one with more impact (did you consider square crop?).  This could have been great.  Sorry, only 6. :-(', '2009-11-01 23:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709863, 827547, 63398, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail!!!......8</td>', 'Incredible detail!!!......8', '2009-11-01 23:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709868, 830624, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the strange skewed perspective, and pretty much everything else about this image......10</td>', 'I like the strange skewed perspective, and pretty much everything else about this image......10', '2009-11-01 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709881, 827613, 52336, '<td valign="top">Oh dear.  :)  Extra points for sarcasm.</td>', 'Oh dear.  :)  Extra points for sarcasm.', '2009-11-02 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709887, 830123, 52336, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent portrait, but I''m not fond of the contrived title and border. 6</td>', 'It''s a decent portrait, but I''m not fond of the contrived title and border. 6', '2009-11-02 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709908, 827318, 52336, '<td valign="top">Neat!  Would have been much better without the vignette (or with a lighter touch on it.)  6</td>', 'Neat!  Would have been much better without the vignette (or with a lighter touch on it.)  6', '2009-11-02 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709958, 829304, 52336, '<td valign="top">I think I understand, but it doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'I think I understand, but it doesn''t quite work for me.', '2009-11-02 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5709960, 830117, 52336, '<td valign="top">Selective desat is a tricky business.  Use carefully, and lightly.  Highlighting those fire engine red rails was a mistake.  Only 5, sorry. :-(</td>', 'Selective desat is a tricky business.  Use carefully, and lightly.  Highlighting those fire engine red rails was a mistake.  Only 5, sorry. :-(', '2009-11-02 00:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710058, 829811, 79955, '<td valign="top">could do away with the red frame (no point deduction , don''t worry). Good effort with the macro. To score really well with a dragonfly shot , need totry to get crisper details on the head. 7</td>', 'could do away with the red frame (no point deduction , don''t worry). Good effort with the macro. To score really well with a dragonfly shot , need totry to get crisper details on the head. 7', '2009-11-02 01:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710059, 829826, 79955, '<td valign="top">Wow , the processing is a little Over the top. Still pretty cool and I like it. 7</td>', 'Wow , the processing is a little Over the top. Still pretty cool and I like it. 7', '2009-11-02 01:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710061, 829186, 79955, '<td valign="top">The lighting &amp; the contrast is great and well executed here in this simplistic approach. 7</td>', 'The lighting & the contrast is great and well executed here in this simplistic approach. 7', '2009-11-02 01:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710063, 830674, 79955, '<td valign="top">The eye needs to be a tad crisper. 6</td>', 'The eye needs to be a tad crisper. 6', '2009-11-02 01:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710064, 830735, 79955, '<td valign="top">I like silhoutte shots with that are clearly defined and this is one excellent example , 8</td>', 'I like silhoutte shots with that are clearly defined and this is one excellent example , 8', '2009-11-02 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710067, 829790, 79955, '<td valign="top">difficult to see what is really going on here, Overall not quite to my taste sorry , 4</td>', 'difficult to see what is really going on here, Overall not quite to my taste sorry , 4', '2009-11-02 01:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710074, 830803, 79955, '<td valign="top">Love the treatment you gave this shot !! the single lightining bolt looks really cool! 8</td>', 'Love the treatment you gave this shot !! the single lightining bolt looks really cool! 8', '2009-11-02 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710077, 829304, 79955, '<td valign="top">the colors are interesting , but I am not sure the movement here really adds to the shot. 5</td>', 'the colors are interesting , but I am not sure the movement here really adds to the shot. 5', '2009-11-02 01:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710079, 830450, 79955, '<td valign="top">Super !!! maybe a bit too dramatic for some, not for me. This is great , 9</td>', 'Super !!! maybe a bit too dramatic for some, not for me. This is great , 9', '2009-11-02 01:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710082, 829892, 66616, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2009-11-02 01:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710171, 830584, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice very professional looking fashion shoot! Not keen on the border though.</td>', 'Nice very professional looking fashion shoot! Not keen on the border though.', '2009-11-02 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710172, 830608, 101117, '<td valign="top">He looks shy as well.<br/> <br/>Very centred composition and a little too close for my liking, it looks like you have some beautiful background there as well, might have been nice to take it from a little further away and include some of that too.</td>', 'He looks shy as well. Very centred composition and a little too close for my liking, it looks like you have some beautiful background there as well, might have been nice to take it from a little further away and include some of that too.', '2009-11-02 03:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710173, 830363, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very pink! This is kinda cute, but kinda weird at the same time. The processing (I''m assuming it''s the processing) has left some blue areas, and has also created a cartoonish look to this.</td>', 'Very pink! This is kinda cute, but kinda weird at the same time. The processing (I''m assuming it''s the processing) has left some blue areas, and has also created a cartoonish look to this.', '2009-11-02 03:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710175, 826973, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, good focus and exposure. The shot doesn''t appeal to me in any great sense, though I couldn''t tell you if there''s a specific reason for that or whether it''s just subject related.</td>', 'Nice action shot, good focus and exposure. The shot doesn''t appeal to me in any great sense, though I couldn''t tell you if there''s a specific reason for that or whether it''s just subject related.', '2009-11-02 03:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710176, 830205, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice picturesque shot, though for me it feels like you''re missing a subject, as if this is the perfect background to create a photo, rather than a photo itself.</td>', 'Very nice picturesque shot, though for me it feels like you''re missing a subject, as if this is the perfect background to create a photo, rather than a photo itself.', '2009-11-02 03:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710177, 830099, 101117, '<td valign="top">Fun and colourful, I like the combination of colours, blue and yellow always go well together. While it''s not the sort of shot that makes you go "wow", it does make you smile, and would make a nice picture to hang in the reception of an office block or something along those lines.</td>', 'Fun and colourful, I like the combination of colours, blue and yellow always go well together. While it''s not the sort of shot that makes you go "wow", it does make you smile, and would make a nice picture to hang in the reception of an office block or something along those lines.', '2009-11-02 03:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710178, 830682, 101117, '<td valign="top">There is a certain devilishness to this. When I first looked at it I thought, "Hmm, I wonder if the bride will be happy with the fact that she looks like an evil queen in this shot", but then I saw your title and figured it was intentional!</td>', 'There is a certain devilishness to this. When I first looked at it I thought, "Hmm, I wonder if the bride will be happy with the fact that she looks like an evil queen in this shot", but then I saw your title and figured it was intentional!', '2009-11-02 03:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710179, 830319, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the feeling of cold comes through very well here, I love the icy blue colour of the sky. It''s a shame about the big tree in the foreground, couldn''t you cut it down for the shot? :)</td>', 'Nicely done, the feeling of cold comes through very well here, I love the icy blue colour of the sky. It''s a shame about the big tree in the foreground, couldn''t you cut it down for the shot? :)', '2009-11-02 03:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710180, 829772, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset silhouette shot. I think for me the feeling in the lower half is a little too dark, I would have liked to see some more detail in the water. Good colours in the sky though.</td>', 'Nice sunset silhouette shot. I think for me the feeling in the lower half is a little too dark, I would have liked to see some more detail in the water. Good colours in the sky though.', '2009-11-02 04:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710181, 827367, 101117, '<td valign="top">Heh, love the colours, he appears to be intently studying something!</td>', 'Heh, love the colours, he appears to be intently studying something!', '2009-11-02 04:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710208, 830395, 45631, '<td valign="top">Love this.  It''s like he''s looking right at ME.  Excellent B/W conversion.</td>', 'Love this.  It''s like he''s looking right at ME.  Excellent B/W conversion.', '2009-11-02 05:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710211, 830482, 45631, '<td valign="top">What a great subject, so much character.  Love it.</td>', 'What a great subject, so much character.  Love it.', '2009-11-02 05:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710227, 830663, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and I like the perspective here. I think you might have gone a little over the top with the processing, which is more apparent in the clouds than the foreground.</td>', 'Very nice light and I like the perspective here. I think you might have gone a little over the top with the processing, which is more apparent in the clouds than the foreground.', '2009-11-02 06:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710262, 830633, 102019, '<td valign="top">Every time I visit this website I always find these peaceful, still waters.  Every time I go to a lake or a pond or a pool, there''s always wind!  I''m so jealous -- I wish I could take a nice still shot like this!<br/> <br/>I''m a little bothered by the framing of this photograph -- it''s too symmetrical.  If you had focused the frame where your V point was off to one side it would have created more movement for the eye.  But otherwise, I love it!</td>', 'Every time I visit this website I always find these peaceful, still waters.  Every time I go to a lake or a pond or a pool, there''s always wind!  I''m so jealous -- I wish I could take a nice still shot like this! I''m a little bothered by the framing of this photograph -- it''s too symmetrical.  If you had focused the frame where your V point was off to one side it would have created more movement for the eye.  But otherwise, I love it!', '2009-11-02 07:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710268, 830573, 102019, '<td valign="top">My eye wishes that there was something to grab me -- something to pull me into the photo.</td>', 'My eye wishes that there was something to grab me -- something to pull me into the photo.', '2009-11-02 07:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710271, 829797, 102019, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great photographer so I have no idea how to achieve some of this, but I''m bothered by a couple things in this photo.  I don''t like the straight-on angle of the chamber to the lens of the camera.  If the gun was angled down a little bit, so we could also see the top and see the perspective fading back, it would be better for me.  Also, I think the depth of field is too shallow and I would have tried to get the background more in focus.  Too much of this picture is fuzzy (I hate fuzzy!), and therefore it just feels like a bunch of wasted space.</td>', 'I''m not a great photographer so I have no idea how to achieve some of this, but I''m bothered by a couple things in this photo.  I don''t like the straight-on angle of the chamber to the lens of the camera.  If the gun was angled down a little bit, so we could also see the top and see the perspective fading back, it would be better for me.  Also, I think the depth of field is too shallow and I would have tried to get the background more in focus.  Too much of this picture is fuzzy (I hate fuzzy!), and therefore it just feels like a bunch of wasted space.', '2009-11-02 07:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710272, 830471, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s a little boring.</td>', 'It''s a little boring.', '2009-11-02 07:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710275, 828921, 102019, '<td valign="top">This photo leaves me wanting for a larger, more detailed subject.  What are those teeny tiny objects that he''s throwing away? One looks like a briefcase, which I was only able to deduce from the title of the photo.  The second, that thing trailing from his body, I have no clue what it is.  Is this a story about him, or about the sky?  I''m not interested in the sky at all in this shot.</td>', 'This photo leaves me wanting for a larger, more detailed subject.  What are those teeny tiny objects that he''s throwing away? One looks like a briefcase, which I was only able to deduce from the title of the photo.  The second, that thing trailing from his body, I have no clue what it is.  Is this a story about him, or about the sky?  I''m not interested in the sky at all in this shot.', '2009-11-02 07:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710278, 830685, 79955, '<td valign="top">wow !! extreme macro. wish you had post processed this a little differently to reduce the slight overexposure.<br/>7</td>', 'wow !! extreme macro. wish you had post processed this a little differently to reduce the slight overexposure.7', '2009-11-02 08:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710279, 830541, 79955, '<td valign="top">No vote , excellent shot , excellent depth in the image</td>', 'No vote , excellent shot , excellent depth in the image', '2009-11-02 08:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710280, 830663, 79955, '<td valign="top">no vote , processing is much improved in this version. should do well as the votes come in.</td>', 'no vote , processing is much improved in this version. should do well as the votes come in.', '2009-11-02 08:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710282, 828282, 79955, '<td valign="top">Great shot !! well captured. The slight overexposure in the clouds a little distracting though. 8</td>', 'Great shot !! well captured. The slight overexposure in the clouds a little distracting though. 8', '2009-11-02 08:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710284, 830768, 79955, '<td valign="top">The colors and composition are fabulous, 8</td>', 'The colors and composition are fabulous, 8', '2009-11-02 08:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710286, 830600, 79955, '<td valign="top">Love the tones , perspective of your shot. Maybe lacking a human interest , still an excellent shot 8</td>', 'Love the tones , perspective of your shot. Maybe lacking a human interest , still an excellent shot 8', '2009-11-02 08:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710288, 830214, 79955, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh. Nicely setup and lighted, 7</td>', 'Made me laugh. Nicely setup and lighted, 7', '2009-11-02 08:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5710289, 829125, 79955, '<td valign="top">stupendous shot !!! How did you capture this shot ? The details are magnificent. I would have loved to see the entire barn owl , wings and all. my 1st 10</td>', 'stupendous shot !!! How did you capture this shot ? The details are magnificent. I would have loved to see the entire barn owl , wings and all. my 1st 10', '2009-11-02 08:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
