(5711946, 829643, 106447, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the sky.<br/> <br/>The nature of the HDR photos tend to give a surreal look.  Unfortunately I think there is a discrepancy in that respect between the sky and the rest of the picture (ie. one part of the photo looks very surreal, but the rest looks unprocessed). It''s hard to find that balance with HDR.<br/> <br/>Also there is not a whole lot going on in the foreground, maybe a better subject as the main focus of the picture would have made things a bit more interesting.</td>', 'Nice capture of the sky. The nature of the HDR photos tend to give a surreal look.  Unfortunately I think there is a discrepancy in that respect between the sky and the rest of the picture (ie. one part of the photo looks very surreal, but the rest looks unprocessed). It''s hard to find that balance with HDR. Also there is not a whole lot going on in the foreground, maybe a better subject as the main focus of the picture would have made things a bit more interesting.', '2009-11-03 09:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
