(5715513, 830510, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice - really like the colors and composition - just wish there was more clarity and definition.  Maybe a little more height/less width too... <i>maybe</i>.  Up to 7 from 6.</td>', '7 - Very nice - really like the colors and composition - just wish there was more clarity and definition.  Maybe a little more height/less width too... maybe.  Up to 7 from 6.', '2009-11-05 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715526, 828510, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Beautiful scene and I really like the way the clouds can be seen behind the first mountain, in almost 3D - however the unnaturalness of the green in the trees, especially on the fore mountain detracts from the overall beauty of the image.  Whilst this grows on you a little, I can''t bring it into another type of image (eg: surreal, fantasy, etc (perhaps as your title suggests)) while the rest of the scene hasn''t quite pushed any similar color/processing boundaries - if that makes sense.</td>', '6 - Beautiful scene and I really like the way the clouds can be seen behind the first mountain, in almost 3D - however the unnaturalness of the green in the trees, especially on the fore mountain detracts from the overall beauty of the image.  Whilst this grows on you a little, I can''t bring it into another type of image (eg: surreal, fantasy, etc (perhaps as your title suggests)) while the rest of the scene hasn''t quite pushed any similar color/processing boundaries - if that makes sense.', '2009-11-05 15:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715543, 830308, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Good potential.  Like the concept.  Nice roses.  As is, a more refined crop, especially at the right and bottom would have given this more of an edge in my opinion.  Some tweaking in post processing would also have taken this a little further.  Just noticed the man at the last minute - I guess the first thought is that the capture of him looking at the camera like this gives a snapshottish feel to it and whilst perhaps he could be incorporated into the image as an element, it may have been best to clone him out, maybe.  Also, ''next time'', trying to get the bunch of roses bottom left, the ones behind the two main players, fully within the ''fork frame'', rather than obstructed by a leaf or two, would just help refine this a little more.</td>', '4 - Good potential.  Like the concept.  Nice roses.  As is, a more refined crop, especially at the right and bottom would have given this more of an edge in my opinion.  Some tweaking in post processing would also have taken this a little further.  Just noticed the man at the last minute - I guess the first thought is that the capture of him looking at the camera like this gives a snapshottish feel to it and whilst perhaps he could be incorporated into the image as an element, it may have been best to clone him out, maybe.  Also, ''next time'', trying to get the bunch of roses bottom left, the ones behind the two main players, fully within the ''fork frame'', rather than obstructed by a leaf or two, would just help refine this a little more.', '2009-11-05 16:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715553, 830513, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice soft glow with depth.  I like it.</td>', 'Nice soft glow with depth.  I like it.', '2009-11-05 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5715569, 828845, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Unique.  Like the colors/processing.  Wish it were just a fraction sharper/more definition, but perhaps it is there ''full size'' and the size restrictions are hindering you.</td>', '8 - Unique.  Like the colors/processing.  Wish it were just a fraction sharper/more definition, but perhaps it is there ''full size'' and the size restrictions are hindering you.', '2009-11-05 16:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
