(5716486, 830224, 70270, '<td valign="top">OK, I admit it, I am soooooooooooooo freaking tired of water droplets I skip right past most of them with a big old yawn.  But not this one.  Showed me something different.  And for that you get an 8.  Nah, strike that.  Make it a 9.</td>', 'OK, I admit it, I am soooooooooooooo freaking tired of water droplets I skip right past most of them with a big old yawn.  But not this one.  Showed me something different.  And for that you get an 8.  Nah, strike that.  Make it a 9.', '2009-11-06 14:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
