(5716652, 829968, 7743, '<td valign="top">If the bird shape is the focal point then I think zooming in more on the bike seat is in order to give the image some impact.  As it is, the shape is too small to carry the image.</td>', 'If the bird shape is the focal point then I think zooming in more on the bike seat is in order to give the image some impact.  As it is, the shape is too small to carry the image.', '2009-11-06 16:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
