(5716803, 828622, 101117, '<td valign="top">What a colourful scene! I think compositionally it''s a little cluttered, from the grass in the foreground to the standing rocks in the middle of the shot, there is too many distinct points of focus.</td>', 'What a colourful scene! I think compositionally it''s a little cluttered, from the grass in the foreground to the standing rocks in the middle of the shot, there is too many distinct points of focus.', '2009-11-06 19:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
