(5716838, 830343, 50695, '<td valign="top">ok, I''m sure this is going to score high, but I can''t ignore this coup de grace, either. I give you the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'ok, I''m sure this is going to score high, but I can''t ignore this coup de grace, either. I give you the Posthumous Blue Ribbon. ', '2009-11-06 19:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
