(5716841, 830726, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good processing to give it a dramatic look. I like the fact that you didn''t choose to go with the long exposure style shot, this one is much cleaner and nicer. Like the rippled reflection!</td>', 'Nice composition and good processing to give it a dramatic look. I like the fact that you didn''t choose to go with the long exposure style shot, this one is much cleaner and nicer. Like the rippled reflection!', '2009-11-06 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
