(5716846, 829133, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is very stimulating. It grabs hold of the viewer and inserts itself into his or her consciousness with more than a thimbleful of meaning. As soon as I finish this cigarette I give you the Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is very stimulating. It grabs hold of the viewer and inserts itself into his or her consciousness with more than a thimbleful of meaning. As soon as I finish this cigarette I give you the Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-11-06 19:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716850, 830351, 101117, '<td valign="top">Initially I just saw the lighthouse and big wave, after that I spotted the person ad the door and though, "Hmm, they stand a very large chance of getting wet", but after that I spotted the person to the left of the frame, what exactly are they up to???<br/> <br/>As for the shot, it''s a good dramatic well timed capture. I recognise this lighthouse from another shot, but I think in that one it was all frozen.</td>', 'Initially I just saw the lighthouse and big wave, after that I spotted the person ad the door and though, "Hmm, they stand a very large chance of getting wet", but after that I spotted the person to the left of the frame, what exactly are they up to??? As for the shot, it''s a good dramatic well timed capture. I recognise this lighthouse from another shot, but I think in that one it was all frozen.', '2009-11-06 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716852, 830076, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot to highlight a fascinating object. That in itself is not enough to win a Posthumous ribbon, but I find this photo emotionally satisfying as well, projecting some sort of world that I want to be in, so I give you a posthumous yellow ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'This is a good shot to highlight a fascinating object. That in itself is not enough to win a Posthumous ribbon, but I find this photo emotionally satisfying as well, projecting some sort of world that I want to be in, so I give you a posthumous yellow ribbon. ', '2009-11-06 19:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
