(5716862, 830337, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo. this makes me happy. What a great composition and use of sun. <br/> <br/>I''m giving out some extra yellows because I can''t NOT give this a ribbon.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow the third:<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Fantastic photo. this makes me happy. What a great composition and use of sun.  I''m giving out some extra yellows because I can''t NOT give this a ribbon. Posthumous Yellow the third: ', '2009-11-06 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
