(5716940, 827461, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice picturesque scene with good colours and exposure especially with the sun in the frame!<br/> <br/>I think if you had got it with the sun just a touch lower it might have looked better and avoided that "large blob in the sky" thing that the sun tends to do in photos.</td>', 'Nice picturesque scene with good colours and exposure especially with the sun in the frame! I think if you had got it with the sun just a touch lower it might have looked better and avoided that "large blob in the sky" thing that the sun tends to do in photos.', '2009-11-06 20:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716941, 828111, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, though this feels a little grainy, as if you started with a lot of noise then sharpened it.</td>', 'Good action shot, though this feels a little grainy, as if you started with a lot of noise then sharpened it.', '2009-11-06 20:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
