(5716960, 829047, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract shot. It''s a little confusing to look at with all the lines and lights and I can''t figure out what exactly it is. I think I would have liked it a bit more if a little more of the left had side was cropped off, as I feel I can see past something on the left, which takes away slightly from the abstractness of it.</td>', 'Interesting abstract shot. It''s a little confusing to look at with all the lines and lights and I can''t figure out what exactly it is. I think I would have liked it a bit more if a little more of the left had side was cropped off, as I feel I can see past something on the left, which takes away slightly from the abstractness of it.', '2009-11-06 20:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716962, 830434, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice fun autumn shot! I like the fact that the children are also wearing autumn like colours.<br/> <br/>It does feel just a touch tight, I didn''t see the leaves straight away as obvious as they are, maybe if it was just a touch more open at the top and bottom it would look better, although I could be completely wrong!</td>', 'Nice fun autumn shot! I like the fact that the children are also wearing autumn like colours. It does feel just a touch tight, I didn''t see the leaves straight away as obvious as they are, maybe if it was just a touch more open at the top and bottom it would look better, although I could be completely wrong!', '2009-11-06 20:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716964, 830314, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I particularly like the lighting under the bridge where most of it is in shadow with the nice colours shining out from under each arch.</td>', 'This is really nice. I particularly like the lighting under the bridge where most of it is in shadow with the nice colours shining out from under each arch.', '2009-11-06 20:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716966, 829011, 101117, '<td valign="top">Those are some really strong colours in those flowers. I can''t tell whether that came from processing or whether that''s actually their natural colour, which I guess is a good thing!</td>', 'Those are some really strong colours in those flowers. I can''t tell whether that came from processing or whether that''s actually their natural colour, which I guess is a good thing!', '2009-11-06 20:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5716971, 830343, 101117, '<td valign="top">My guess is that this is the London Eye, and initially thought you were going to get DQ''d on it, until I spotted it had been validated. Now I would just love to know how you pulled this off within the editing rules!</td>', 'My guess is that this is the London Eye, and initially thought you were going to get DQ''d on it, until I spotted it had been validated. Now I would just love to know how you pulled this off within the editing rules!', '2009-11-06 20:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
