(5716975, 829835, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very interesting fashion style shoot. It''s a touch too dark in areas for me, like the lower right corner. Also, the background object in the right is obviously there without being identifiable which I don''t think helps.</td>', 'Very interesting fashion style shoot. It''s a touch too dark in areas for me, like the lower right corner. Also, the background object in the right is obviously there without being identifiable which I don''t think helps.', '2009-11-06 20:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
