(5717056, 828736, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - I''m thinking you have more detail full size than what is shown here.  Your black framing dominates too much and detracts the ''delicateness'' of the image.</td>', '4 - I''m thinking you have more detail full size than what is shown here.  Your black framing dominates too much and detracts the ''delicateness'' of the image.', '2009-11-06 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717059, 825796, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Almost missed him - a variation in composition, probably just wish a squarer crop, coupled with no border of a variation of it, make this better in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Almost missed him - a variation in composition, probably just wish a squarer crop, coupled with no border of a variation of it, make this better in my opinion.', '2009-11-06 23:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717061, 830563, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice portrait of Marco.  Be nice to see his other eye too, but as is is still good - however, I do think he''d look less incarcerated if he could lose that chain and nose/snout restraint/guard thing (whatever that is).  The tones are nice, as is the composition and background.</td>', '6 - Nice portrait of Marco.  Be nice to see his other eye too, but as is is still good - however, I do think he''d look less incarcerated if he could lose that chain and nose/snout restraint/guard thing (whatever that is).  The tones are nice, as is the composition and background.', '2009-11-06 23:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717063, 828837, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Cool catch.  Difficult, but some type of crop variation to reduce the competing colors in the background - perhaps also, if possible, trying to get a little sharper, especially on the left Collider.</td>', '7 - Cool catch.  Difficult, but some type of crop variation to reduce the competing colors in the background - perhaps also, if possible, trying to get a little sharper, especially on the left Collider.', '2009-11-06 23:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717065, 830056, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Yes they are beautiful, be nice to see a little more of the pink hues, especially for visual balance - maybe a little more foreground if possible.  Not sure about other angles, but my first thought was "wish I could see straight through, without mountains/etc in the background" - only to admire the colors, lighting and very nice sculpture even more.</td>', '7 - Yes they are beautiful, be nice to see a little more of the pink hues, especially for visual balance - maybe a little more foreground if possible.  Not sure about other angles, but my first thought was "wish I could see straight through, without mountains/etc in the background" - only to admire the colors, lighting and very nice sculpture even more.', '2009-11-06 23:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
