(5717780, 825946, 63218, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=831779" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_831779.jpg"/></a> <br/>It wasn''t until later that I noticed the splashes of <br/>red-orange in the BG, &amp; the square shape which I can imagine is a bee hive, for honey. There''s a wonderful feeling of sunny breezes in this that creates a happy face on me. The color of the shadows on the pink petals is just perfect.</td>', ' It wasn''t until later that I noticed the splashes of red-orange in the BG, & the square shape which I can imagine is a bee hive, for honey. There''s a wonderful feeling of sunny breezes in this that creates a happy face on me. The color of the shadows on the pink petals is just perfect.', '2009-11-07 14:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
