(5717875, 829539, 76335, '<td valign="top">A nice pose, but the smile feels very unnatural. Too forced. Also, I''m not sure I like how she''s situated in the frame. There''s too much space to her right, with no real subject there to add counterpoint or balance. In fact, it feels like a void -- like someone should be there but left. Nice lighting.</td>', 'A nice pose, but the smile feels very unnatural. Too forced. Also, I''m not sure I like how she''s situated in the frame. There''s too much space to her right, with no real subject there to add counterpoint or balance. In fact, it feels like a void -- like someone should be there but left. Nice lighting.', '2009-11-07 18:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5717876, 830721, 76335, '<td valign="top">Points for the title alone. Lovely (if ominous) lighting.</td>', 'Points for the title alone. Lovely (if ominous) lighting.', '2009-11-07 18:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
