(5718179, 827455, 101117, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is a little harsh, especially in the foreground, I"m guessing that is the result of some direct flash. Other than that the colours and the fall are nice.</td>', 'The lighting here is a little harsh, especially in the foreground, I"m guessing that is the result of some direct flash. Other than that the colours and the fall are nice.', '2009-11-07 22:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
