(5718190, 829286, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait, but I feel that the jacket and scarf are a bit in the way here, they''re sitting a little bulky on the model. Perhaps a change of stance would have helped.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait, but I feel that the jacket and scarf are a bit in the way here, they''re sitting a little bulky on the model. Perhaps a change of stance would have helped.', '2009-11-07 22:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
