(5718192, 830221, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but I don''t like the toning you have added in the processing. I always feel that flora looks better in colour  than mono or duo tone.</td>', 'Nice macro, but I don''t like the toning you have added in the processing. I always feel that flora looks better in colour  than mono or duo tone.', '2009-11-07 22:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718194, 830635, 106349, '<td valign="top">Aren''t we all! (we photographers)</td>', 'Aren''t we all! (we photographers)', '2009-11-07 22:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718195, 830633, 101117, '<td valign="top">From top to bottom this is nice until you reach the path running across the lower section. I understand the inclusion of some foreground detail, but because the rest of the shot is so vivid and in nice light, the path just feels a little dull grey.</td>', 'From top to bottom this is nice until you reach the path running across the lower section. I understand the inclusion of some foreground detail, but because the rest of the shot is so vivid and in nice light, the path just feels a little dull grey.', '2009-11-07 22:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718197, 830099, 106349, '<td valign="top">Colors are great in this shot. Love the one flower in focus.</td>', 'Colors are great in this shot. Love the one flower in focus.', '2009-11-07 22:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718198, 830468, 101117, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and perspective here, it''s really vivid and unusual.</td>', 'I like the colours and perspective here, it''s really vivid and unusual.', '2009-11-07 22:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718199, 830318, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait and good lighting. There''s some strange details going on here, perhaps from over compression, and also to the right side of the frame there''s some odd objects that I''m not sure where they could have come from as they should be in the OOF area of the shot.<br/> <br/>I''m thinking most of this has come from the processing, which being advanced editing you should have been able to avoid.</td>', 'Nice portrait and good lighting. There''s some strange details going on here, perhaps from over compression, and also to the right side of the frame there''s some odd objects that I''m not sure where they could have come from as they should be in the OOF area of the shot. I''m thinking most of this has come from the processing, which being advanced editing you should have been able to avoid.', '2009-11-07 22:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
