(5718208, 830418, 90495, '<td valign="top">Can I suggest blurring some of her dress and shoulders. This would help put the focus on her face and eyes. Right now, I have too much in focus to look at and my eyes aren''t concentrating on her beautiful face.</td>', 'Can I suggest blurring some of her dress and shoulders. This would help put the focus on her face and eyes. Right now, I have too much in focus to look at and my eyes aren''t concentrating on her beautiful face.', '2009-11-07 22:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
