(5718268, 830640, 41337, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2009-11-07 23:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718272, 830490, 101117, '<td valign="top">Doing some last minute checking and making sure I didn''t miss commenting on anything interesting and this definitely fits the bill!<br/> <br/>There''s a slightly surreal feel to parts of this, it reminds me of something out of an adventure movie with all the vivid colours and swirls. Really like it!</td>', 'Doing some last minute checking and making sure I didn''t miss commenting on anything interesting and this definitely fits the bill! There''s a slightly surreal feel to parts of this, it reminds me of something out of an adventure movie with all the vivid colours and swirls. Really like it!', '2009-11-07 23:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718273, 830624, 100831, '<td valign="top">Interesting, Nice wide angle and color work.</td>', 'Interesting, Nice wide angle and color work.', '2009-11-07 23:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718276, 830226, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like this but i wish you had included the whole shadow. Nice and sharp, excellent contrast of b/w. Good job.</td>', 'I like this but i wish you had included the whole shadow. Nice and sharp, excellent contrast of b/w. Good job.', '2009-11-07 23:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5718277, 830548, 101117, '<td valign="top">Having a last minute run through to make sure I don''t miss commenting on anything interesting and this caught my attention. There''s not a whole lot in here but it''s still a really nice interesting image. I like the lines and the way they curve off to the left just at the start of the frame.<br/> <br/>The detail is a little hard to make out, but that''s not a bad thing as the real appeal to this is the overall shot and the feeling. <br/> <br/>Nicely composed, great feeling to it, I like it!</td>', 'Having a last minute run through to make sure I don''t miss commenting on anything interesting and this caught my attention. There''s not a whole lot in here but it''s still a really nice interesting image. I like the lines and the way they curve off to the left just at the start of the frame. The detail is a little hard to make out, but that''s not a bad thing as the real appeal to this is the overall shot and the feeling.  Nicely composed, great feeling to it, I like it!', '2009-11-07 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
