(5718577, 830178, 30982, '<td valign="top">Just remember that there are all levels of folks here, including newbies who think everything must be crisp, clean, rule of thirds, etc.  They''ll come along - give ''em time.  And there are those who will never like this kind of thing.  Their loss.  Just keep doing what you do.  A commenter average of 8.2 with 15 comments in a FS is freakin'' amazing.</td>', 'Just remember that there are all levels of folks here, including newbies who think everything must be crisp, clean, rule of thirds, etc.  They''ll come along - give ''em time.  And there are those who will never like this kind of thing.  Their loss.  Just keep doing what you do.  A commenter average of 8.2 with 15 comments in a FS is freakin'' amazing.', '2009-11-08 07:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5718581, 830563, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think your choice to flip this works, and I love the shot.  Makes me smile.  Worth the $25.  :-)</td>', 'I think your choice to flip this works, and I love the shot.  Makes me smile.  Worth the $25.  :-)', '2009-11-08 07:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
