(5718607, 829521, 66384, '<td valign="top">I still love this shot, and am envious. I think Waddy might be right about the muted colors reducing the impact, even though Mary liked the low saturation. I think that although the dark part in the feathers below his beak gives him a very stern expression, it overpowers his real mouth, which I''d like to see featured a bit more. I like the way you finished the image with the border. Congrats for the good score and high placement in this crowded challenge.</td>', 'I still love this shot, and am envious. I think Waddy might be right about the muted colors reducing the impact, even though Mary liked the low saturation. I think that although the dark part in the feathers below his beak gives him a very stern expression, it overpowers his real mouth, which I''d like to see featured a bit more. I like the way you finished the image with the border. Congrats for the good score and high placement in this crowded challenge.', '2009-11-08 07:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
