(5720169, 830584, 51538, '<td valign="top">It is a great work of creativity.  I like the tone and processing, more or less.  But there is one thing that stands out as breaking the spell you are weaving; that is the shadow under the jaw.  It makes the face look more like a mask than a face, if you see what I mean.  For me, that takes away the naturalness of the situation.</td>', 'It is a great work of creativity.  I like the tone and processing, more or less.  But there is one thing that stands out as breaking the spell you are weaving; that is the shadow under the jaw.  It makes the face look more like a mask than a face, if you see what I mean.  For me, that takes away the naturalness of the situation.', '2009-11-09 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
