(5753944, 830092, 90495, '<td valign="top"><i>I guess my little Troll Hunter didn''t discourage the <u>Trolls</u> from showing up.<br/>You <u>Trolls</u> are relentless.<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>I appreciate the comments that were given. I even appreciate the <u>trolls</u> who voted the extremely low scores, but I will not be held responsible for what my troll hunter does to you when he finds you. <br/></i> <br/> <br/>Stop expecting your images to do very well, especially in a FS, and the trolls will disappear. :D<br/> <br/>Cool looking monkey but he looks freaked out, must be the cage. ;|<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-12-04 10:34:29.</i></td>', 'I guess my little Troll Hunter didn''t discourage the Trolls from showing up.You Trolls are relentless. :) I appreciate the comments that were given. I even appreciate the trolls who voted the extremely low scores, but I will not be held responsible for what my troll hunter does to you when he finds you.   Stop expecting your images to do very well, especially in a FS, and the trolls will disappear. :D Cool looking monkey but he looks freaked out, must be the cage. ;|', '2009-12-04 10:33:37.000000', '2009-12-04 10:34:29.000000', 0),
