(6064613, 830814, 75713, '<td valign="top">When I look at this photo I want to live there.  Imagine waking up in the morning, going outside (with a cup of coffee in hand) and just filling up your eyes wit such beauty.  And you captured it perfectly.  I imagine the folks who live there would love a copy of this photo.  <br/>I would love to know how you pped it to bring out all of the beauty.  It''s beyond what I can do and I am in awe of your shot.</td>', 'When I look at this photo I want to live there.  Imagine waking up in the morning, going outside (with a cup of coffee in hand) and just filling up your eyes wit such beauty.  And you captured it perfectly.  I imagine the folks who live there would love a copy of this photo.  I would love to know how you pped it to bring out all of the beauty.  It''s beyond what I can do and I am in awe of your shot.', '2010-06-21 13:29:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6086396, 827493, 74911, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed. The tight closeup and the cold expressions go very well. <br/> <br/>I believe the processing could have been better. There seems to be a heavy loss of details in the eyes. I would emphasize on the eyes, so that they pop out and be more prominent in such a tight close-up.</td>', 'This is nicely composed. The tight closeup and the cold expressions go very well.  I believe the processing could have been better. There seems to be a heavy loss of details in the eyes. I would emphasize on the eyes, so that they pop out and be more prominent in such a tight close-up.', '2010-07-09 11:50:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6096249, 829017, 117831, '<td valign="top">wow this is stunning!</td>', 'wow this is stunning!', '2010-07-18 16:09:53.000000', NULL, 0),
