(6227428, 825861, 68504, '<td valign="top">I like this very much - the view, and all that intelligently extracted detail and colour rendered by you and the LX3. Particularly like the point of view.  All in all it reminds me strongly of an old postcard view, photographer unacknowledged, possibly hand tinted, very Japanese printlike.</td>', 'I like this very much - the view, and all that intelligently extracted detail and colour rendered by you and the LX3. Particularly like the point of view.  All in all it reminds me strongly of an old postcard view, photographer unacknowledged, possibly hand tinted, very Japanese printlike.', '2010-11-19 00:41:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6310771, 827422, 69246, '<td valign="top">Reminds me also of Freiburg Germany.</td>', 'Reminds me also of Freiburg Germany.', '2011-02-12 14:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6450176, 830678, 12611, '<td valign="top">At first I though- Cape Cod?- but then, the exotic nature came through. The subtle horizon is done very well; the trees in the shot create the feel the swamp, the cool air, the ultramarine bleeds into cerulean, then to cobalt in the foreground- I wonder if photogs intentionally go for the blues in the  skies they shoot, whether it is a subconsciously done or not- this is great. and finally the lighting on the right side provides a warmth and gives context- I love when emphasis is derived through warmth of the color values rather than pure light  and dark and foreground focus issues.</td>', 'At first I though- Cape Cod?- but then, the exotic nature came through. The subtle horizon is done very well; the trees in the shot create the feel the swamp, the cool air, the ultramarine bleeds into cerulean, then to cobalt in the foreground- I wonder if photogs intentionally go for the blues in the  skies they shoot, whether it is a subconsciously done or not- this is great. and finally the lighting on the right side provides a warmth and gives context- I love when emphasis is derived through warmth of the color values rather than pure light  and dark and foreground focus issues.', '2011-06-22 10:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6592587, 830126, 120171, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, my eye is naturally drawn to the two kids in the light but with the everything else that is going on in the right of the frame it makes a an interesting shot that captivates.</td>', 'I really like this shot, my eye is naturally drawn to the two kids in the light but with the everything else that is going on in the right of the frame it makes a an interesting shot that captivates.', '2011-11-11 18:28:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6641823, 826443, 4767, '<td valign="top">Amazing light on the House on Fire.  (Haven''t been back since we were there together.  Let me know when you want to go back again.)</td>', 'Amazing light on the House on Fire.  (Haven''t been back since we were there together.  Let me know when you want to go back again.)', '2012-01-11 01:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
